Error [E0112]: `data.schema` needs a typed table or series, not Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/data_schema_requires_typed_container.jet:4:17
    |
  4 |     data.schema(1)
    |                 ^
 Why: core.data schema reads column names and types from the row model
 Fix: pass a `Table<T>`, `Series<T>`, `LazyFrame<T>`, or `[T]` value
